"Ask me why," Tamsin says again, and finally looks up from the tally. Her eyes go over you once, then past you, toward the man in the ration line. He is still watching your ship. "People come back to this stall when they owe me, or when I owe them. Which are you offering?"

*Putting your name in her ledger and meaning it would be a Make a Connection.*

